{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "5afe9372-2d96-887d-ac30-554222ca0ab8",
  "created_at": "2026-01-20T13:21:04-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Sofia Moniz",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Sandra Pimentel",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T13:17:55-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Sandra. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T13:17:59-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, Sandra. I'm calling about a mobile vendor license. For the summer."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T13:18:03-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, sure, I can point you in the right direction. What are you thinking of selling? Food, or more like crafts and goods?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T13:18:11-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Food. Little baked things, out of a cart. Nothing fancy. Sorry, I'm on speaker, my hands are full of paperwork."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T13:18:18-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem at all, I can hear you fine. So for food you'll generally have a license from us, and then there's usually a health side to it as well, kitchen and food handling, that kind of thing. Those are separate."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T13:18:31-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So two different places. Of course it's two."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T13:18:35-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] Ha, I know. It usually is. The license application is something you can pick up here at City Hall, and I can see about getting one sent to you too."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T13:18:45-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Picking it up works. I'm on Gidley Street, so I'm not far. Hold on one second."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T13:18:51-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Take your time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T13:18:53-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry. There's a recorder being practiced in the next room. It's the same four notes. Over and over. It's growing on me, slowly."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T13:19:01-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, that's sweet. Well, as long as it's the same four notes and not a new song every day, right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T13:19:08-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. Anyway. How long is the license valid once I have it? Is it for the season, or the year, or what?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T13:19:15-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good question. Most of these licenses run for a set period and then you renew, but I don't want to tell you the exact dates off the top of my head. Let me check the sheet here. Can you hold for a moment?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T13:19:28-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, I'm not going anywhere."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T13:19:30-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I'm back. It's good for a limited term and it doesn't carry over automatically, so you'd renew it each year if you want to keep going. The application will list the exact term and the dates."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T13:19:42-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So I'd need to do this every year. Fine. And if I get it in the winter, does the clock start then, or when summer starts?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T13:19:50-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It generally goes by when it's issued, so I'd time it so you're not paying for months you're not using. If you want, come in closer to when you plan to start and we can go over it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T13:20:02-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That makes sense. What do I bring with me when I come in?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T13:20:07-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Bring a photo ID, and whatever you have on what you'll be selling and where you plan to set up. The application will tell you if anything else is needed, like the health approval."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T13:20:18-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Photo ID, description of the cart, where I'll be parked. Got it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T13:20:23-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it. We're open until the end of the afternoon, Tuesday through the week, so you could even stop by today."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T13:20:30-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Maybe later this week. Today I've got the recorder to supervise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T13:20:34-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, good luck with that. Would you like me to put an application aside with your name on it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T13:20:40-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please. Moniz. M-O-N-I-Z. First name Sofia."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T13:20:43-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, Sofia Moniz. I'll have it at the front counter for you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T13:20:48-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. If something comes up, my number is 401-555-0183."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T13:20:52-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect, I've got it down. Anything else I can help with today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T13:20:56-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's all. Thanks, Sandra."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T13:20:58-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Have a good afternoon, and enjoy the music."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T13:21:02-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll try. Bye."
    }
  ],
